%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
%listTrialTypes
%By: Brielle Ferguson
%Date: 12/1/24
%Will take the trial structure generated by readAnalyzePlotBehData, and
%find the available trial types within a specific field. E.g., for the
%field 'cuelength' will tell user he cue lengths collected for a particular
%session are 2s, 1s, 500 ms and 50 ms. 
%Inputs:
% - trials: data structure with trial information from a behavioral session
% - field: field the user wants to pull the trial types from
%Outputs:
% - num: how many unique trial types there are 
% - vals: the specific values of the unique trial types
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------
function [num,values] = listTrialTypes(trials, field)
for i = 1:length(trials)
    if ~isempty(trials(i).(field))
    yourField(i) = trials(i).(field);
    end
end

values = sort(unique(yourField),'ascend');
num = length(values); 
end